die Begriffe Steuerbarkeit, Beobachtbarkeit, Stabilisierbarkeit und Rekonstruierbarkeit eingeführt,\nsowie die algebraische und geometrische Theorie entwickelt. Dazu kommt die Stabilisierung von Gleich-\ngewichtslagen und die optimale Steuerung dieser Systeme.\n\nProblems in engineering and economics often can be described by time continuous or time discrete dy-\nnamical systems. The concepts of controllability, observability, stabilizability and reconstructability will\nbe introduced and developed for both classes of problems. Furthermore stabilization of equilibria and\noptimal control will be covered.', 'test_description': '', 'ects_i': 10, 'ects_str': '10', 'name_str': 'Kontrolltheorie (Fak. II)', 'group': 'Keine Angabe', 'institute_str': 'Institut für Mathematik'}, {'id': 20157, 'name': 'Matrizentheorie', 'version': 1, 'language': 'DE', 'ects': '5', 'parts': [{'name_part': 'Matrizentheorie', 'type': 'VL', 'cycle': 'WiSe/SoSe'}, {'name_part': 'Matrizentheorie', 'type': 'UE', 'cycle': 'WiSe/SoSe'}], 'degrees': [{'name_degree': 'Mathematik (B. Sc.) - Bachelor Mathematik 2014', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'B', 'stupo': 24377}, {'name_degree': 'Technomathematik (B. Sc.) - StuPO 2014', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'B', 'stupo': 24379}, {'name_degree': 'Wirtschaftsmathematik (B. Sc.) - StuPO 2014', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'B', 'stupo': 24386}, {'name_degree': 'Mathematik (M. Sc.) - StuPO 2014', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'M', 'stupo': 24410}, {'name_degree': 'Wirtschaftsmathematik (M. Sc.) - StuPO 2014', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'M', 'stupo': 24411}, {'name_degree': 'Technomathematik (M. Sc.) - StuPO 2014', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'M', 'stupo': 24412}], 'exam_type_str': 'oral', 'faculty': 'Fakultät II', 'institute': 'Institut für Mathematik', 'group_str': 'Keine Angabe', 'module_description': 'In dieser Veranstaltung sollen spezielle Themen der Matrizentheorie erlernt werden.\r\n\r\nFachkompetenz: 55% Me