 Sprache zur technischen und rechtlichen Machbarkeit eines Produkts (Gruppenarbeit)\r\n\r\n-Online Recherche', 'test_description': '', 'ects_i': 6, 'ects_str': '6', 'name_str': 'Informationsmanagement', 'group': '33321500 FG Lebensmittelverfahrenstechnik', 'institute_str': 'Institut für Lebensmitteltechnologie und Chemie'}, {'id': 30555, 'name': 'Kolloquium BSc Biotechnologie (benotet)', 'version': 5, 'language': 'DE', 'ects': '3', 'parts': [], 'degrees': [{'name_degree': 'Biotechnologie (B. Sc.) - StuPO 2014', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'B', 'stupo': 24423}], 'exam_type_str': 'continuous', 'faculty': 'Fakultät III', 'institute': 'Institut für Biotechnologie', 'group_str': '33311100 FG Medizinische Biotechnologie', 'module_description': '', 'test_description': '', 'ects_i': 3, 'ects_str': '3', 'name_str': 'Kolloquium BSc Biotechnologie (benotet)', 'group': '33311100 FG Medizinische Biotechnologie', 'institute_str': 'Institut für Biotechnologie'}, {'id': 30556, 'name': 'Fungal Biotechnology in the Post-Genomic Era', 'version': 4, 'language': 'EN', 'ects': '3', 'parts': [{'name_part': 'Fungal Biotechnology in the Post-Genomic Era', 'type': 'SEM', 'cycle': 'WiSe/SoSe'}], 'degrees': [{'name_degree': 'Biotechnologie (M. Sc.) - StuPO 2014', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'M', 'stupo': 24456}], 'exam_type_str': 'continuous', 'faculty': 'Fakultät III', 'institute': 'Institut für Biotechnologie', 'group_str': '33311400 FG Angewandte und Molekulare Mikrobiologie', 'module_description': 'The students will need to:\r\n•\tthink scientifically based on current topics of fungal biotechnology, i.e. understand current stand and challenges of the research in the field\r\n•\tbe able to do independent literature research on a selected topic of fungal biotechnology\r\n•\tdevelop an own project proposal to address an open question of fungal biotechnology, and write an abstract of their project\r\n•\tcritically discuss their ideas in groups, and present them to their peers