rocessing.\n- Axiomatic definition of probability: probability space \r\n- Equiprobable events, counting, and discrete probability\r\n- Random variables and cumulative distribution functions\r\n- Discrete random variables \r\n- Continuous random variables\r\n- Random vectors\r\n- Gaussian multivariate distributions and related distributions\r\n- Change of measure\r\n- Transform methods: probability generating function, characteristic function, moment generating function\r\n- Weak Law of large numbers, Central Limit Theorem, and large deviations\r\n- MMSE estimation and the orthogonality principle\r\n- Stochastic convergence\r\n- Markov Chains\r\n- Wide-sense stationary processes and spectral representation', 'test_description': '', 'ects_i': 6, 'ects_str': '6', 'name_str': 'Foundations of Stochastic Processes', 'group': '34331600 FG Theoretische Grundlagen der Kommunikationstechnik', 'institute_str': 'Institut für Telekommunikationssysteme'}, {'id': 40258, 'name': 'Angewandte Lichttechnik', 'version': 7, 'language': 'DE', 'ects': '6', 'parts': [{'name_part': 'Beleuchtungstechnik', 'type': 'PJ', 'cycle': 'WiSe/SoSe'}, {'name_part': 'Beleuchtungstechnik I', 'type': 'VL', 'cycle': 'SoSe'}, {'name_part': 'Laboratorium zur Lichttechnik', 'type': 'PR', 'cycle': 'WiSe/SoSe'}, {'name_part': 'Praktikum Lichttechnik I', 'type': 'PR', 'cycle': 'WiSe/SoSe'}], 'degrees': [{'name_degree': 'Architektur (M. Sc.) - StuPO 2011 (26.10.2011)', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'M', 'stupo': 24248}, {'name_degree': 'Technomathematik (M. Sc.) - StuPO 2014', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'M', 'stupo': 24412}, {'name_degree': 'Elektrotechnik (M. Sc.) - StuPO 2015', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'M', 'stupo': 24536}, {'name_degree': 'Computer Engineering (M. Sc.) - StuPO 2015', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'M', 'stupo': 24540}, {'name_degree': 'Computer Science (Informatik) (M. Sc.) - StuPO 2015', 'semester_degree': 'SS2024', 'bama': 'I', 'stupo': 24541}, {'name_deg